 all responsible for collaborating on one final dish, correct?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_04_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_04_s_13","text":"That means it's more important than ever to coordinate with one another.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_04_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_04_s_14","text":"To that end, let's practice cooking with a partner today. How does that sound?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_04_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce_003_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_04_s_15","text":"No disagreements here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_04_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_04_s_16","text":"All right then, first things first:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_04_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_04_s_17","text":"Let's go buy the ingredients we need for a solid curry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce003_1_04_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ade","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce003_1_04_s_18","text":"If you head down the stairs and go straight ahead, you'll see the store where we usually buy ingredients.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","i